<ansi fg="black-bold">─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</ansi>

<ansi fg="red-bold">Admin:</ansi> with the proper role, <ansi fg="command">reload</ansi> also reloads server data files:

  <ansi fg="command">reload items</ansi>          Reload item data files (including new ones).
  <ansi fg="command">reload biomes</ansi>         Reload biome data files.
  <ansi fg="command">reload translations</ansi>   Reload all translation/localization files.
  <ansi fg="command">reload mapcache</ansi>        Clear the mapper's per-zone cache so the
                         next <ansi fg="command">map</ansi> rebuilds from current room data.
